# After a reload, a destination that is the second of two same-named sibling projects stays the second one.
file <<END
Home:
	Ideas:
		- first
	Ideas:
		- second
END
keys qq
type Paint fence
keys <Space> /
type ideas
keys <Down> <Enter>
outside <<END
Home:
	- Outside line
	Ideas:
		- first
	Ideas:
		- second
END
status Reloaded
see Quick Add → Home › Ideas
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Home:
	- Outside line
	Ideas:
		- first
	Ideas:
		- second
		- Paint fence
END
